# Presentations: the present extension (org-present)
Output docs/media/present.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-present; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/present.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/talk.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap :Org present | start the slideshow` Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Type ":Org present" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap n next slide` Enter
Show
Type "n"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "n"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "n"
Sleep 2.5s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap p previous slide` Enter
Show
Type "p"
Sleep 2s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap 1 the whole file on one page` Enter
Show
Type "1"
Sleep 3s
Type "1"
Sleep 1.5s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap G last slide` Enter
Show
Type "G"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 300ms
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <Esc> back to the untouched file` Enter
Show
Sleep 3s
